WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.250
The written process says 4711 Opex. The expert picks 0400 Capex.

00:00:04.936 --> 00:00:10.618
Mira: You coded invoice 4471 to 0400 instead of 4711.

00:00:11.073 --> 00:00:12.250
Mira: What made you do that?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.750
Sabine: “Equipment over five thousand euros are always capex,”

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.550
Sabine: “so it goes to zero four hundred.”

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:21.650
Click the rule: the moment on screen, the field she changed, her exact words.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.150
Live run: 9 of 11. It learned from the two misses. Next round: 11 of 11.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.600
Capex booking. No asset number yet.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.350
Mira: Sabine would stop here. Why do you think?

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.700
Mira: Her rule: hold a capex booking until asset accounting provides an asset number.
